WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.950
In Manage hosting, open File manager.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:06.257
Pick the website.

3
00:00:06.257 --> 00:00:09.450
Its public HTML folder opens.

4
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:11.710
Click Upload, and choose your file.

5
00:00:11.710 --> 00:00:14.047
Files up to 4 MB work here.

6
00:00:14.047 --> 00:00:16.102
For bigger ones, use FTP.

7
00:00:16.152 --> 00:00:22.972
The file appears in the list as soon as the upload finishes.
